## Gate conclusion

The HTTP-only Super runtime and same-bind STUN evidence are present, and the
forbidden Super-runtime/PSKey/v1-handler scans are otherwise clean. However,
the approval gate cannot waive the mandatory preservation, write-ownership, or
per-task TDD-evidence requirements. Remediate/document `88de103`, reconcile
Task 12's write-set, and supply valid RED→GREEN evidence for Tasks 4, 9, 10,
11, and 12 before re-audit.

